st, so rebooked on the next-best option, AL706 (08:45\u201317:10), free of charge.\n- **R-3003 (basic economy)** \u2192 cancelled free of charge, since basic economy fares can't be changed/rebooked.\n- **R-3004** \u2192 cancelled free of charge per the passenger's note requesting a refund instead of rebooking.\n\nAll affected passengers have been notified accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4638, "output_tokens": 293, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfTMC5sYdniaZ9zCVAzTd"}], "trace_id": "01M3GKF5XMCBNA8Y5SFZC5T981", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3GKF5XMCBNA8Y5SFZC5T981", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-27T04:55:12.052810Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-27T04:55:42.188502Z", "duration_ms": 30135.692, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3GKF5XM57MY3RQHQE4NP4TQ", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.089, "tokens": {"input": 11958, "output": 3334, "cache_read": 10386, "cache_write": 0}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3GKF5XMMKB9HV2FD5WBNM3T", "trace_id": "01M3GKF5XMCBNA8Y5SFZC5T981", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-27T04:55:12.052823Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-27T04:55:42.188462Z", "duration_ms": 30135.639, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3GKF5XM57MY3RQHQE4NP4TQ", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"},